title: Tanfana
---
Tanfana: I can sense your desperation mortal, and I know what troubles you. The Hellhound... that pest keeps trespassing in my sacred forest! I want it gone, and I think we share that goal. You have my chalice? Impressive, mortal. Become my servant, pledge your soul to me, and I shall bestow upon you the power to kill the Hellhound.
	-> Offer your soul
	  Tanfana: As expected. Take my blessing, mortal, and rid me of that wretched stray.
	  <<TanfanaChoice>>
	-> Don't offer your soul
	  Tanfana: You dare scorn me, mortal?! Wait until you feel my wrath, you will regret this!You dare scorn me, mortal?! Wait until you feel my wrath, you will regret this!
===
